<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian CFAO Q1 profits rise.</title>
<headline>Nigerian CFAO Q1 profits rise.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter results for Nigerian conglomerate CFAO to end-March 1997, published on Monday. (In million naira)</p>
<p>					  1997	   1996</p>
<p> Turnover			    2,000	  1,700</p>
<p> Profit before taxation	     78	     63</p>
<p> Taxation				 25	     20</p>
<p> Profit after taxation		53	     43</p>
<p>($1=83.5 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
